 "remarks": "Completely renovated and move-in ready 2-bedroom condo at Fountain Terrace, a gated community in a prime Stamford location. Situated on the 4th floor, this bright unit features an open-concept living and dining area, Luxury Vinyl Flooring, Kitchen crown molding, abundant natural light, and a private balcony with city views. The updated kitchen offers stainless-steel appliances, stone countertops, ample cabinetry, and a dishwasher. Both bedrooms provide generous space and closet storage, plus a fully renovated bath. Brand new refrigerator will be provided by the owner prior to occupancy.   Rent includes heat, hot water, cooking gas, water, security, landscaping, snow and trash removal... with Two assigned parking spaces! Amenities include a pool, fitness center, playground, elevator, laundry, guest parking and 24-hour security. Minutes to Downtown Stamford, Metro-North, Amtrak, shopping, dining, parks, and I-95.",
